                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The list of persons who lunched with Roosevelt and Churchill is taken from the
                    Log, <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg843">p. 843</ref>. No
                    record of the discussion has been found, and there is no evidence that matters
                    of substance were discussed.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
